<details><summary>Event source integration</summary><p>POST JSON with <code>id</code> (unique event ID), <code>message_id</code> (the exact SMTP Message-ID), <code>type</code> (delivered, soft-bounce, hard-bounce or complaint), and <code>event_at</code> (UTC, for example 2026-10-16T14:00:00Z).</p><p>Set <code>X-Message-Monkey-Timestamp</code> to the current Unix timestamp and <code>X-Message-Monkey-Signature</code> to the hexadecimal HMAC-SHA256 of <code>timestamp + "." + raw JSON</code> using the signing key. Signatures expire after five minutes. Events are deduplicated by ID; event timestamps must be within 30 days.</p></details></section>
